const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"信息含量关注持久影响",en:"Information content concerns the persistent response"},body:{zh:"Hasbrouck研究交易之后报价的长期调整，而不是只看成交后的即时价格跳动。短期反应可能包含库存管理和交易摩擦；持久部分更接近论文想识别的信息作用。把两者区分开，才能理解为什么一次成交价变化并不等于信息被完整揭示。",en:"Hasbrouck studies the eventual quote adjustment following a trade rather than only its immediate price movement. Short-run responses can include inventory management and trading frictions. Separating these from the persistent component explains why a single transaction-price change does not measure the complete revelation of information."},reference:{url:"https://www.acsu.buffalo.edu/~keechung/MGF743/Readings/K2.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1991年期刊版，第179–181页",en:"Source: 1991 journal article, pp. 179–181"}}},{title:{zh:"关键是未被预期的交易部分",en:"Focus on the unexpected component of trading"},body:{zh:"交易本身可能延续此前的成交与报价信息。论文关注在给定过去信息后仍无法预期的交易创新，并分析它随后引起的报价响应。直接把全部买入成交量与价格变化相连，会混合可预测订单流和新增信息，回答的已不是同一个问题。",en:"Trades can be predictable from earlier trades and quote changes. The paper focuses on the trading innovation left after conditioning on past information and traces the subsequent quote response. Relating all buyer-initiated volume directly to price changes mixes predictable order flow with new information and answers a different question."},reference:{url:"https://www.acsu.buffalo.edu/~keechung/MGF743/Readings/K2.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1991年期刊版，第180–183页",en:"Source: 1991 journal article, pp. 180–183"}}},{title:{zh:"滞后关系组成一个动态系统",en:"Lags form a dynamic system"},body:{zh:"向量自回归把交易与报价修订放进同一滞后系统，允许信息在多个事件后逐步体现。由此得到的长期响应依赖变量选择、滞后长度和交易过程假设。它不是把一条回归的当期系数简单命名为永久冲击，模型设定也需要随结果保留。",en:"A vector autoregression places trades and quote revisions in a joint lagged system, allowing adjustment over several events. Its long-run response depends on variables, lag structure and assumptions about trading. It is not merely a contemporaneous regression coefficient renamed as permanent impact; the specification must accompany the result."},reference:{url:"https://www.acsu.buffalo.edu/~keechung/MGF743/Readings/K2.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1991年期刊版，第181–183页",en:"Source: 1991 journal article, pp. 181–183"}}},{title:{zh:"报价中点与成交价各有角色",en:"Quotes and transaction prices play different roles"},body:{zh:"论文以报价中点描述价格修订，并给成交赋予买方或卖方发起的方向。中点处的成交方向可能无法明确识别。只保存成交价和成交量会失去当时报价背景；方向判定规则也应单独记录，不能把推断方向当成交易所直接提供的事实。",en:"Quote midpoints describe price revisions, while trades receive buyer- or seller-initiated signs. Trades at the midpoint can be indeterminate. Keeping only transaction prices and volume loses the quote context; retain the signing rule separately rather than treating an inferred direction as an exchange-observed fact."},reference:{url:"https://www.acsu.buffalo.edu/~keechung/MGF743/Readings/K2.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1991年期刊版，第181–182, 191–192页",en:"Source: 1991 journal article, pp. 181–182, 191–192"}}},{title:{zh:"事件时间不等于钟表时间",en:"Transaction time is not clock time"},body:{zh:"样本使用1989年第一季度的交易和报价记录，并按规模组选取公司。模型的事件索引会在交易或报价出现时推进；报价与成交还经过时间匹配处理。因此一个滞后不是固定的一分钟，不能用规则时间柱机械替代原研究的事件序列。",en:"The sample uses first-quarter 1989 trades and quotes from companies selected across size groups. The transaction time index advances with trade or quote events, with additional quote–trade timing alignment. A lag is therefore not a fixed minute; regular time bars cannot mechanically substitute for the original event sequence."},reference:{url:"https://www.acsu.buffalo.edu/~keechung/MGF743/Readings/K2.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1991年期刊版，第190–192页",en:"Source: 1991 journal article, pp. 190–192"}}},{title:{zh:"持久响应不自动证明私人信息",en:"Persistence alone does not prove private information"},body:{zh:"公开新闻、报价调整方式和交易摩擦都可能影响所估计的响应。论文讨论的识别依赖其结构和信息假设；数据匹配误差也可能改变交易与报价的先后关系。评价结果时需要同时阅读模型限制和清洗方法，而不是把每次持久变动归因于知情交易者。",en:"Public news, quote adjustment and trading frictions can influence the estimated response. Identification depends on the model's structural and information assumptions, while matching errors can alter the order of trades and quotes. Read these limits alongside preprocessing rather than assigning every persistent movement to an informed trader."},reference:{url:"https://www.acsu.buffalo.edu/~keechung/MGF743/Readings/K2.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1991年期刊版，第180–183, 191–192页",en:"Source: 1991 journal article, pp. 180–183, 191–192"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"交易的信息含量依赖报价、成交方向、事件排序与模型设定。历史样本中的长期报价响应不能直接解释为每笔交易的私人信息，更不能只靠分钟行情复现。",en:"Information content depends on quotes, trade signs, event ordering and model specification. A persistent quote response in this historical design does not identify private information in every trade, and minute bars alone cannot reproduce it."}};export{e as default};
